  "body": "Brand New 4-Bedroom Home in Torbay\r\n\r\nWelcome to your pristine, brand-new sanctuary nestled in the heart of one of the North Shore’s most highly sought-after coastal communities. 12D Rewi Street is a masterclass in modern living, offering an exceptional blend of sophisticated design, ultimate comfort, and a vibrant neighbourhood lifestyle.\r\n\r\nFeaturing four spacious bedrooms and three beautifully appointed bathrooms, this immaculate new build is perfectly tailored for growing families, professionals, and those seeking a premium, low-maintenance coastal lifestyle without compromising on space.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights\r\n• Brand New Construction: Step into a flawless, contemporary home featuring high-end fixtures, double glazing, open plan living, and abundant natural light.\r\n• Space & Versatility: Four generous bedrooms provide ample room for the whole family, with flexibility for a dedicated home office or guest suite.\r\n• Luxurious Bathrooms: Three elegantly tiled bathrooms (including a master ensuite) designed to handle busy family mornings, and relaxing evening unwinds.\r\n• Entertainer’s Dream: The state-of-the-art kitchen flows seamlessly into the living and dining areas, extending outward for effortless indoor-outdoor summer entertaining.\r\n\r\nTop-Tier Education Zones\r\nFor families, this address provides massive peace of mind, falling in-zone for some of the North Shore’s most highly regarded schools. Say goodbye to stressful morning commutes with exceptional education options just minutes from your front door with Torbay School, Northcross Intermediate & Long Bay College.\r\n\r\nFantastic early childhood options, including Torbay Playcentre and Torbay Kindergarten, are also located less than 600 meters away.\r\n\r\nMake It Yours Today\r\nBrand-new builds of this caliber, situated in such a deeply established and tightly held coastal location, are a rare market find. 12D Rewi Street offers you the chance to secure a turn-key home where the only thing left to do is move in and head to the beach.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a private viewing or join us at our upcoming open homes. Your coastal Torbay dream starts right here.",
